--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -5,3 +5,15 @@
 - Rooms, users, bookings and amenities endpoints.
 - Pagination on list endpoints.
 - Conflict detection when creating a booking.
+
+## Unreleased
+
+- `GET /availability` returns the free slots per room for a time window, so
+  clients can pick a time instead of probing with repeated booking attempts.
+- A booking conflict now suggests the next free slots of the requested length.
+- Fixed conflict detection, which only looked at the start of the new booking
+  and so let a booking that ran into an existing one be created.
+- `PATCH /bookings/:id` now checks for conflicts instead of allowing a booking
+  to be moved on top of another one.
+- Bookings with `endsAt` at or before `startsAt` are rejected.
+- Booking an unknown room or user answers 404 instead of 500.
